    "body": "#### vim-patch:40295c9: runtime(go): prevent code injection with keywordprg\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/40295c92be643a09d6443121637fa93d6cd105a1\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Christian Brabandt <cb@256bit.org>\r\n\r\n\r\n#### vim-patch:0fa6704: runtime(sshconfig): correctly escape search pattern for keywordprg\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/0fa670400bda8d78f90287c9b80af57fbb76ef55\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Christian Brabandt <cb@256bit.org>\r\n\r\n\r\n#### vim-patch:52ce28a: runtime(systemd): use script-local function for keyword lookup\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/52ce28a4ad0ec9df8eebb6556ebf677cc46ddbe8\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Christian Brabandt <cb@256bit.org>\r\n\r\n\r\n#### vim-patch:9.2.1177: [security]: possible code injection via rubycomplete\r\n\r\nProblem:  [security]: possible code injection via rubycomplete\r\n          (tnshima)\r\nSolution: Do not use eval() for arbitrary buffer text\r\n\r\nGithub Security Advisory:\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/security/advisories/GHSA-4xgr-vqh2-xfx8\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/05d704d2856dbb75e95bd33cf222c2e6264fff8b\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Christian Brabandt <cb@256bit.org>\r\n\r\n\r\n#### vim-patch:9.2.1178: [security]: code injection via rmd syntax pattern\r\n\r\nProblem:  [security]: code injection via rmd syntax pattern for fenced\r\n          languages (ylerni7-ant)\r\nSolution: Keep only the leading word characters of the language name\r\n          in the syntax script.\r\n\r\nGithub Security Advisory:\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/security/advisories/GHSA-x2w5-pj55-7hpc\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/7670338d8b695c476de868dabd34d68d6de2443b\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Christian Brabandt <cb@256bit.org>",
